# Query URL from Subgraph Studio, or the Graph Network gateway URL after
# `graph publish`. Read server-side only: this key must never reach the browser.
# Use the version/latest form. A pinned version label starts returning
# 200 {"message":"Not found"} the moment a new version is published, which
# is a failure that looks like a healthy response.
SUBGRAPH_URL=https://api.studio.thegraph.com/query/110471/ringo-polygon/version/latest
# Not needed for a Studio endpoint: verified identical 200 and identical body
# with and without an Authorization header. Never put the Studio DEPLOY key
# here. It only starts mattering after `graph publish` moves queries to the
# gateway.
SUBGRAPH_API_KEY=
